WEBVTT

NOTE Authored baseline guidance. Offline synthetic Flite SLT narration. Sentence timing measured from exact PCM frames and verified with FFprobe; not word/phoneme alignment.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.370
Authored guidance, with offline synthetic narration.

2
00:00:03.620 --> 00:00:08.360
This single-cylinder teaching engine starts at
twelve hundred revolutions per minute.

3
00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:15.525
Play shows power, exhaust, intake, then compression
across two crank turns; cams turn once.

4
00:00:15.775 --> 00:00:18.130
Motion is slowed sixty times.

5
00:00:18.380 --> 00:00:23.430
Pause, select a declared part, then take apart and
pull it or use its slider.

6
00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:27.750
Put that part back, or cancel to restore the
inspection entry.

7
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:31.815
Reset restores phase zero, keeping accepted
settings.

8
00:00:32.065 --> 00:00:36.685
Keep a comparison, change bore or stroke, and
compare displacement.

9
00:00:36.935 --> 00:00:42.330
Engine speed is prescribed; pulling never
disconnects it and forces are not solved.

10
00:00:42.580 --> 00:00:47.990
Live questions require your own account and profile
policy, and remain held.

